- Introduced Evidence Handoff to provide a public list of evidence after compaction.
- Implemented logic to filter out evidence from the summary to prevent context inflation.
- Enhanced the rendering of inspected files, verified commands, and outstanding todos in the evidence handoff.
- Updated tests to verify the correct behavior of the new evidence handoff feature, ensuring it does not replace the original LLM summary.
- Added handling for moved files and command omissions in the evidence reporting.

